From 29edb50315ada0357fe1e63fc32eea8c42c04036 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:13:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] n950tr: boot tracer for the kexec black-screen investigation

Record boot progress where a serial console would be: a RAM record at
0x9F000000 and one OneNAND page per stage in mtd3's second block (survives
any reset).  Stages run from the first instruction of the zImage, through
an image self-checksum, the decompressor, head.S, start_kernel and the
init sequence to the exec of init; panic(), die() and the head.S error
loops are recorded too.  See arch/arm/include/asm/n950trace.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
